 114:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** * Function Name: VDAC_LP_Start
 115:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** ********************************************************************************
 116:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *
 117:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** * Summary:
 118:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *  The start function initializes the voltage DAC with the default values, 
 119:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *  and sets the power to the given level.  A power level of 0, is the same as
 120:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *  executing the stop function.
 121:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *
 122:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** * Parameters:
 123:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *  Power: Sets power level between off (0) and (3) high power
 124:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *
 125:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** * Return:
 126:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *  void 
 127:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *
 128:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** * Global variables:
 129:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *  VDAC_LP_initVar: Is modified when this function is called for the 
 130:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *  first time. Is used to ensure that initialization happens only once.
 131:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *
 132:Generated_Source\PSoC5/VDAC_LP.c **** *******************************************************************************/
